        <mxCell id="3Q5-SiNo01uAgwgzAvHF-49" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="1. git init -- initialise khali folder ko into the repository&lt;br&gt;2. git add * - staging&lt;br&gt;3. git commit - message ke sath / .git ke record me chala gya&lt;br&gt;4. git remote add - connect krta hai remote repo ke sath&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;5. git push -&amp;nbsp; Code push krta hai on remote (GitHub)&lt;br&gt;6. git pull --khich kr liya ta saara naya code ya branches lata hai local jab ham main branch par hai&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;7. git branch - list all branches of git repo and of your local&lt;br&gt;8. git checkout -b &amp;lt;branchname&amp;gt; ---&amp;gt; create new branch&lt;br&gt;9.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;git checkout &amp;lt;branchname&amp;gt; ---&amp;gt; existing branch me enter kara deta h&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;10. git merge origin/main ---&amp;gt; khich kr layegi sara naya code local feature branch par.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
